{"baseRefName":"fix/provider-classification","baseRefOid":"027a89391c10c5cbb76685197a318a59b52a8c4a","body":"## Summary\n\nCloses the five mobile-preview findings from the audit sweep:\n\n- **iOS mid-transfer cap** — `curl` now sends `Range: 0-(maxBytes-1)` so chunked responses are bounded on the wire, not just via the post-hoc `size_download` check.\n- **Session-lock messaging** — a competing launcher now reports \"session is active or requires lock recovery\" instead of a generic failure, and the lock is acquired before staging so a second launcher can't delete the owner's files. Node-side `acquireNodeSession` distinguishes `EEXIST` from real fs errors.\n- **Android `am` validation** — `am`/`termux-am` can print `Error:` on intent resolution while still exiting 0; launcher output is now captured and scanned, so a dead handoff fails instead of overclaiming success.\n- **Exit-code contract** — `MobileExit.code` is typed `0 | 1 | 2`; the status-file parser and bridge normalize string statuses from `jsc` and fail closed to `1` on malformed input.\n- **Bare-JavaScriptCore fidelity** — the fake-host harness now strips non-JSC globals (`process`, `URL`, `fetch`, `TextEncoder`, …) before executing the iOS bundle, and shared `portable-url.ts` was rewritten to a hand-rolled WHATWG-https parser so `new URL` is gone from the iOS path (Android/Node redirect handling still uses it).\n\n#### Test plan\n\n- [x] `bun run apps/mobile/scripts/build.ts` — 2 targets built under the stripped-global harness\n- [x] Mobile integration suite: 25 pass / 0 fail / 111 expects\n- [x] New `portable-url` unit tests cover dot-segments, ports, IPv6, encoding sets\n- [x] SH syntax check on all four a-Shell helper scripts\n\nStacked on #541.","files":[{"path":".docs/mobile-terminal-runtime.md","additions":17,"deletions":3,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"apps/mobile/scripts/ashell/kunai-mobile","additions":10,"deletions":2,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"apps/mobile/scripts/build-contract.ts","additions":22,"deletions":2,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"apps/mobile/scripts/build.ts","additions":63,"deletions":2,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"apps/mobile/src/application/contracts.ts","additions":5,"deletions":2,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"apps/mobile/src/application/portable-url.ts","additions":131,"deletions":17,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"apps/mobile/src/runtime/android/android-player-port.ts","additions":14,"deletions":4,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"apps/mobile/src/runtime/android/node-http-port.ts","additions":17,"deletions":3,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"apps/mobile/src/runtime/android/node-session.ts","additions":14,"deletions":3,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"apps/mobile/src/runtime/ashell/ashell-command-bridge.ts","additions":1,"deletions":1,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"apps/mobile/src/runtime/ashell/curl-config.ts","additions":1,"deletions":0,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"apps/mobile/test/unit/application/portable-url.test.ts","additions":76,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"apps/mobile/test/unit/runtime/android/android-player-port.test.ts","additions":27,"deletions":1,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"apps/mobile/test/unit/runtime/android/node-session.test.ts","additions":34,"deletions":1,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"apps/mobile/test/unit/runtime/ashell/ashell-command-bridge.test.ts","additions":16,"deletions":0,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"apps/mobile/test/unit/runtime/ashell/curl-config.test.ts","additions":1,"deletions":0,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"apps/mobile/test/unit/scripts/build-contract.test.ts","additions":10,"deletions":0,"changeType":"MODIFIED"}],"headRefName":"fix/mobile-host-proof","headRefOid":"c742199bca280c4ceffcfddfa2b41cc4dbf80f39","mergeable":"MERGEABLE","number":542,"reviewDecision":"","statusCheckRollup":[{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-10-02T23:25:54Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/KitsuneKode/kunai/actions/runs/3707752318